WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
If your prep is PEG, this video will walk you through exactly how to take it,

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.230
just follow along step by step. Your PEG prep is the large container that you'll

3
00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.120
mix with water.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.720
You'll also want Crystal Light or flavor packs on hand if you'd like to improve

5
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:13.200
the taste.

6
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.440
At 8 a.m. the day before your procedure, you'll mix the prep.

7
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:21.930
Add water to your prep container and stir or shake until everything is fully

8
00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:22.720
dissolved.

9
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:27.680
Once it's mixed, put it in the refrigerator. Keeping it cold makes it much

10
00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:28.400
easier to drink.

11
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.880
If you're adding Crystal Light or a flavor pack, you can mix that in now.

12
00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.400
Just make sure it's not red, orange, blue, or purple.

13
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:42.720
Stick to clear or light colored flavors. Between 4 and 5 p.m., you'll begin

14
00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:43.280
drinking the solution.

15
00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:49.660
Here's the pace. Drink 16 ounces, that's about two cups every 30 minutes. You

16
00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:50.240
'll keep going

17
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:54.410
at that pace for about four hours until the entire container is empty. Take

18
00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:55.680
your time with each

19
00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:00.090
glass. Slow, steady sips are easier on your stomach than trying to gulp it all

20
00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:00.720
at once.

21
00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:05.600
This part is really important. You must drink all of the prep solution as

22
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.480
directed,

23
00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:10.880
even if you're already passing clear liquid. I know it can feel like enough,

24
00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:14.750
but finishing the entire dose is what gives us the clearest view during your

25
00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:15.280
procedure.

26
00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:20.510
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither

27
00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:21.280
of us wants that.

28
00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:26.880
Once you've finished, keep drinking clear liquids until bedtime. Staying hydrated will

29
00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:30.710
help you feel better and help the prep do its job. If you experience any

30
00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:31.760
discomfort from

31
00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:35.600
frequent trips to the bathroom, applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper

32
00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.880
rash cream can really help.

33
00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:42.210
That's it. You've got this. Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay

34
00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:42.800
hydrated.

35
00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.740
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office. We're here

36
00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:47.120
to help.
